                    the Executive Secretariat.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d387-f2" n="2" xml:id="d387-f2-content">
                <p>Donold B. Lourie, Under Secretary of State for
                    Administration.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d387-f3" n="3" xml:id="d387-f3-content">
                <p>Herman Phleger, Legal Adviser.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d387-f4" n="4" xml:id="d387-f4-content">
                <p>Fisher Howe, Deputy Special Assistant for
                    Intelligence.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d387-f5" n="5" xml:id="d387-f5-content">
                <p>Secretary Dulles flew to Denver on Sept. 6
                    and met with the vacationing President at Lowry Air Force Base, Denver, at 9
                    a.m., Monday morning, Sept. 7. (Dulles
                    papers, “Daily Appointments”; Eisenhower Library, Eisenhower records, “Daily
                    Appointments”) No record of the conversation has been found.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
